{
  "name": "WF-1-mini — Inbound Handler (MVP)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-1",
      "name": "Catatan — Sebelum Pakai",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-20, -260],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sebelum dipakai\n1. Import `wf2-mini-lead-capture.json` LEBIH DULU, aktifkan workflow-nya.\n2. Isi node **Config** (chatwootBaseUrl, accountId, sheetId).\n3. Di setiap node **Panggil WF-2-mini**, buka dropdown workflow dan pilih ulang WF-2-mini (ID lama tidak akan cocok di instance ini).\n4. Aktifkan webhook di Chatwoot: Settings → Integrations → Webhook, event `message_created`, arahkan ke URL produksi node **Webhook Chatwoot** di bawah.\n5. **Path payload webhook (`$json.body....`) adalah asumsi berdasarkan dokumentasi internal — cek payload asli lewat satu kali tes kirim pesan, sesuaikan path di node Filter/Code kalau berbeda.**\n6. Semua label yang dipasang lewat WF-2-mini harus sudah dibuat manual di Chatwoot Settings → Labels.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webhook",
      "name": "Webhook Chatwoot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-20, 60],
      "webhookId": "dilatih-chatbot-inbound",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "dilatih-chatbot-inbound",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [200, 60],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "a1", "name": "chatwootBaseUrl", "type": "string", "value": "https://GANTI-DENGAN-URL-CHATWOOT" },
            { "id": "a2", "name": "accountId", "type": "string", "value": "GANTI-DENGAN-ACCOUNT-ID" },
            { "id": "a3", "name": "sheetId", "type": "string", "value": "GANTI-DENGAN-GOOGLE-SHEET-ID" }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "keepOnlySet": false }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "filter",
      "name": "Filter Pesan Valid",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [420, 60],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "c1", "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.message_type }}", "rightValue": "incoming", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } },
            { "id": "c2", "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.sender && $json.body.sender.type }}", "rightValue": "contact", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } },
            { "id": "c3", "leftValue": "={{ ($json.body.conversation.labels || []).includes('bot-off') || ($json.body.conversation.labels || []).includes('human-takeover') }}", "rightValue": "true", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEquals" } },
            { "id": "c4", "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.conversation.assignee_id }}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stop-invalid",
      "name": "Stop — Bukan Pesan Valid",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [640, 220],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "dedupe",
      "name": "Dedupe",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [640, 60],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nif (!staticData.processedIds) staticData.processedIds = [];\n\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const msgId = item.json.body.message && item.json.body.message.id;\n  if (msgId && staticData.processedIds.includes(msgId)) continue; // sudah diproses, skip\n  if (msgId) staticData.processedIds.push(msgId);\n  if (staticData.processedIds.length > 500) staticData.processedIds = staticData.processedIds.slice(-500);\n  out.push(item);\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "notes": "Kalau item ini duplikat, node ini tidak meneruskan apa pun — cabang berhenti secara alami, tidak perlu node stop terpisah."
    },
    {
      "id": "get-contact",
      "name": "Ambil Data Kontak",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [860, 60],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.chatwootBaseUrl }}/api/v1/accounts/{{ $('Config').item.json.accountId }}/contacts/{{ $json.body.contact.id }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": { "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "", "name": "Chatwoot API Token" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "route",
      "name": "Baru vs Menu vs Bebas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [1080, 60],
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "outputKey": "baru",
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  { "id": "r1", "leftValue": "={{ $json.custom_attributes && $json.custom_attributes.bot_state }}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "menu",
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  { "id": "r2", "leftValue": "={{ $json.custom_attributes && $json.custom_attributes.bot_state }}", "rightValue": "menunggu_pilihan", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "bebas",
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  { "id": "r3", "leftValue": "={{ true }}", "rightValue": "true", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "fallbackOutput": "bebas" }
      },
      "notes": "3 output: baru (kirim menu) / menu (user baru pilih 1-4) / bebas (teks bebas, langsung handoff — tidak ada AI di MVP)."
    },
    {
      "id": "kirim-menu",
      "name": "Kirim Menu 4 Pilihan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1300, -140],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.chatwootBaseUrl }}/api/v1/accounts/{{ $('Config').item.json.accountId }}/conversations/{{ $('Webhook Chatwoot').item.json.body.conversation.id }}/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ content: 'Halo! Ada yang bisa kami bantu?\\n1. Sertifikasi BNSP\\n2. Workshop & sertifikasi umum\\n3. Pelatihan untuk perusahaan (B2B/IHT)\\n4. Saya sudah terdaftar — ada kendala\\n\\nBalas dengan angka pilihan ya.', message_type: 'outgoing' }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": { "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "", "name": "Chatwoot API Token" } },
      "notes": "Teks final ambil dari copy-percakapan.md §1, ini cuma placeholder."
    },
    {
      "id": "set-menunggu",
      "name": "Set bot_state=menunggu_pilihan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1520, -140],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.chatwootBaseUrl }}/api/v1/accounts/{{ $('Config').item.json.accountId }}/contacts/{{ $('Webhook Chatwoot').item.json.body.contact.id }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ custom_attributes: { bot_state: 'menunggu_pilihan' } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": { "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "", "name": "Chatwoot API Token" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "route-pilihan",
      "name": "Route Pilihan Menu",
